# The torch: one centered post, square in section and stopping short of the
# cell's top. Floor-mounted, stateless. A body walks THROUGH it (no
# collision) while it still stands in the way of light and the interact ray
# still finds it to dig — the flame is the TEXTURE's business; torch_side
# paints its upper rows as glow.
version 1
shape torch
grid 12
states none
box visual+light+interaction  5 0 5  7 10 7  # post
